OL,3,GNEWSATeenage carer dedicates GCSE
OL,4,Asuccess to late dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage carer has dedicated his GCSE
OL,7,Fsuccess to his late father who died
OL,8,Fearlier this year.
OL,10,FBeckett, from Leicestershire, found out
OL,11,Fon Thursday he had gained nine GCSEs,
OL,12,Ffrom grades 6 to 9, and now hopes his
OL,13,Fresults will help him follow the same
OL,14,Fcareer path as his dad.
OL,16,FNick, a paediatric cardiac
OL,17,Fanaesthetist, suffered from a suspected
OL,18,Fdiagnosis of progressive supranuclear
OL,19,Fpalsy, external, a rare neurological
OL,20,Fcondition, with symptoms similar to
OL,21,FParkinson's, external.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
